turnpikes.test.ts, tests that survive both mutants of turnpikes.ts: 10
mutant A of runs-status.ts, run on turnpikes.test.ts, kills 7 of them:
    a one-leg run's card is GATE
    a one-leg run closes at done
    after synthesis the poll says DISPATCH
    the review leg ends with the card, and no leg follows
    it closes through the postmaster's stages
    after ship the card is GATE, and no leg follows
    a three-leg run keeps its stages
mutant A of stage.ts, run on turnpikes.test.ts, kills 4 of them:
    a one-leg run closes at done
    a one-leg run's stages after the card are the postmaster's
    it closes through the postmaster's stages
    a three-leg run keeps its stages
mutant B of handoff-check.ts, run on turnpikes.test.ts, kills 2 of them:
    the final synthesis hand-off passes its check
    the legacy ship hand-off still passes its check
Together the three mutants kill all 10: 7 + 1 + 2, with "a one-leg run closes at done", "it closes through the postmaster's stages" and "a three-leg run keeps its stages" counted under both runs-status and stage.
